    "result_text": "All 68 tests pass. The change is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `ownerSegment` derived field on the Owner resource.\n\n**What the spec required:** Return `ownerSegment` formatted `<TIER>_<AREA>` \u2014 TIER is `PREMIUM` when `membershipLevel` \u2265 3 (else `STANDARD`), and AREA is `METRO` when the locality is a known region (NSW/VIC/QLD, else `REGIONAL`).\n\n**Changes:**\n\n1. **`src/main/java/.../model/Owner.java`** \u2014 added `getOwnerSegment()`, which reuses the existing derived getters `getMembershipLevel()` and `getLocality()`. It checks membership level \u2265 3 for the tier, and tests locality membership against the region table (NSW/VIC/QLD) for the area.\n\n2. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `ownerSegment` string property (enum of the four values) to the `Owner` schema. The generated `OwnerDto` field is auto-populated by MapStruct's name-based mapping from the new getter, matching how the other derived fields (`locality`, `contactPreference`, etc.) are exposed.\n\nCp55Tests (2 tests) pass, and the full suite is green (68 tests, 0 failures).",
